    "title": "ANBERNIC RG40XX H 4-Inch 3200mAh 64GB Linux 64-bit RGB Retro Handheld Game Console RG40XXH (64GB, 5000+ Games)",
    "body_html": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Service &amp; Warranty Policy</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 14px;\">Please read carefully before purchasing</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 25px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f0f4ff; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">7-Days Warranty</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">Anbernic does not provide warranty services in India. If there is any issues within 7 days replacement period, we will provide the replacement.<br><span style=\"color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px;\">*Requires valid photos/videos of the defect to process the claim.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; margin-bottom: 25px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #ecfdf5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Software &amp; SD Card Support</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">Pre-installed games and OS are provided by Anbernic. For software issues, users must re-flash the SD card by downloading the official firmware here: <a href=\"https://win.anbernic.com/download/\" style=\"color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #2563eb;\" target=\"_blank\">Anbernic Download Center</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #fff1f2; padding: 12px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e11d48\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"15\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 17px; color: #111827;\">Final Sale Policy</h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6;\">We exclusively sell <strong>brand-new products</strong>. As Anbernic does not accept returns, all sales are final. We do not accept returns or offer refunds. Please conduct thorough research before completing your purchase.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 12px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e1e4e8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Authentic Products \u2022 Professional Support</span></div>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMSii9RwJKMQxjdH8hoXqm3tCv0NwJ-QPUxA8DMRIIR66YQhrZumwjXaT5XnnKPgrAZWNbb4b2jCCy5HRL-UH1uT-4VGSX4Z